          "source_quote": "τὰ ἰοβόλα καὶ λυμαντικὰ ζῷα ἐξέβρασεν.",
          "english_quote": "brought forth venomous and destructive animals.",
          "issue": "ἐξέβρασεν expresses casting up or disgorging. The generic 'brought forth' loses the earth's vivid expulsion image. The note acknowledges 'casting up,' but its concern about inventing a mechanism does not justify suppressing an image supplied by the verb itself.",
          "suggested_revision": "Use 'cast up venomous and destructive animals' or 'spewed out venomous and destructive animals,' and revise the lexical note accordingly.",
